  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 309.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 309.02 Applicability. The rules in this part shall apply to all persons owning landfills, including asbestos waste sites, which stopped receiving waste before July 10, 1981, and claiming exemption from the solid waste rules pursuant to Env-Sw 101.04.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300) #8462-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
